        "app_name": "Dolphine and a Climate Crisis - ContentsDa Science Experiment",
        "release_date": "1980-01-01T00:00:00.000Z",
        "description": "1.You are in a boat taking pictures of dolphins from above and fall into the water. When you wake up, you arrive at the lab.\n2.You are trapped in the lab and try to escape by purifying the water and growing trees.\n3.Pour ramen broth into the tank to clean the water, and use the fertilizer from the lab to see the changes in the soil.\n4.Investigate the ecosystem by watering a tree and placing earthworms in the soil.\n5.Go outside and plant trees to solve the problem of polluted air and garbage from factories, and put garbage in drums to be burned in a fire or dumped in the ocean to clean it up.\n6.Bury trash in drums to prevent soil pollution, pick up trash from the ocean, and plant trees to improve the environment.\n7.Go inside the lab and check acid rain with an acid rain meter to raise awareness of environmental pollution, and finally, try to escape.\n8.To commemorate your escape, you arrive at a souvenir shop and buy something to help the environment.",
